{
  "status": "unscored_no_live_outputs",
  "panel": "source-review-record",
  "rules": {
    "denominators": "All 24 scheduled arm trials and all 72 required per-field findings, including not_sent, malformed, incomplete and rejected results; singleton arm dispatches 3 requests per trial, record arm dispatches 1.",
    "meaning": "Judge whole-record meaning and each original field role separately. Equivalent wording and distributed conditions are valid. A faithful identified defect is distinct from complete omission coverage.",
    "coverage": "Never count a broad record pass as three findings. Report missing, duplicate, extra, partial and misbound membership separately; preserve all actual reviewer values unchanged.",
    "localization": "Only admitted actual omissions create downstream full comparison assignments. Score every actual duty and complete assignment, per-comparison meaning, explanation adequacy and both citation completeness and relevance. No expectation substitutes for a reviewer obligation.",
    "repair": "Diagnostic receipts do not mint native origins or repair permission. Eligibility and denied repair require the connected current native authorizer; report unexecuted repair as unexecuted.",
    "interference": "Compare false findings, erased sibling findings, duplicated defects and altered conditions/negation/strength between arms. Conditions need not be repeated in every field.",
    "cost": "Report every sent/not_sent operation and exact actual usage; measured transport timing and end-to-end timing separately. Do not infer fewer calls improve semantic quality.",
    "qualification": "Freeze reserved expectations before outputs; development cases cannot be counted as untouched qualification. No retries, correction, repair dispatch, model judges or E2E are authorized by preparation."
  },
